# Reference genomes may become large.
# Store download instructions / accession IDs in Git instead.
Data/ReferenceGenomes/*
!Data/ReferenceGenomes/.gitkeep

# Data/Samples may contain small example datasets committed
# intentionally for demonstrations and testing.

